---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | Rutledge Digital" description="Get in touch with Rutledge Digital about a website, e-commerce, integration, or maintenance project.">
  <section class="page-hero section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h1>Tell me what you're<br /><span class="accent">trying to make possible.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">A few details about your business and the problem you're solving are a great place to start.</p></section>
  <section class="section-wrap contact-layout">
    <div class="contact-card"><p class="eyebrow">LET'S TALK</p><h2>Have a project in mind?</h2><p>Email is the simplest way to get started. Share what you're looking to build or improve, any timeline you're working toward, and how you'd like the site to help your business.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:erikrutledge.com?subject=Rutledge%20Digital%20project%20inquiry">Email about a project ↗</a></div>
    <div class="contact-aside"><span class="aside-symbol">R<span>.</span></span><h3>Useful details to include</h3><ul><li>What your business does</li><li>What you need the website to accomplish</li><li>Whether you have an existing site</li><li>Your rough budget and timeline</li></ul></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>